# Commit authorship

The Cursor agent is **not a co-author**. Commit identity is only the user's
Git `user.name` / `user.email`.

Never include in a `git commit` message (body, footer, or trailer):

```text
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```

Also forbidden: any `Co-authored-by:` line naming Cursor, cursoragent,
Cursor Agent, or an equivalent IDE identity.

Do not use `--trailer`, `git interpret-trailers`, or an automatic co-author
append. The HEREDOC ends at the commit text.
